    <!-- cpu -->
    <StreamGeometry x:Key="AppIconCpu">M12 20v2 M12 2v2 M17 20v2 M17 2v2 M2 12h2 M2 17h2 M2 7h2 M20 12h2 M20 17h2 M20 7h2 M7 20v2 M7 2v2 M 6 4 H 18 A 2 2 0 0 1 20 6 V 18 A 2 2 0 0 1 18 20 H 6 A 2 2 0 0 1 4 18 V 6 A 2 2 0 0 1 6 4 Z M 9 8 H 15 A 1 1 0 0 1 16 9 V 15 A 1 1 0 0 1 15 16 H 9 A 1 1 0 0 1 8 15 V 9 A 1 1 0 0 1 9 8 Z</StreamGeometry>
